2026-09-02T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2177) 'The tag is `rfd:flight-level:l1`, `l2` or `l3`, as RFD66606-2229 carries `l3` above. With no tag the RFD has no level; the RFD stays off the three per-level pages.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2177) 'Render script
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2177) '`scripts/render_flight_level_pages.py` reads the tag from every serial register and writes three files:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2177) '  pages/flight-level-1-operations.qmd pages/flight-level-2-coordination.qmd pages/flight-level-3-strategy.qmd
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2177) 'Each is a Quarto listing whose `contents:` names the `rfd/NNNN-slug/ index.md` paths of the RFDs tagged at that level. The listing sorts by RFD number descending, matches the format of `pages/rfd.qmd`, and regenerates on every render pass.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

