2026-09-02T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2177) 'Trade-offs recorded
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2177) '- **Tag, not new arc.** A structural namespace (site 5 = Level 1, site 6 = Level 2, site 7 = Level 3) was on the table and dropped. A tag is a data axis; a site is a URN axis. Levels change more often than URNs are allowed to, so a tag fits the churn.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2177) '- **Optional, not required.** Untagged RFDs stay in the register. Retrofitting 176 existing RFDs at once loses more than it gains.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2177) '- **Leopold's numbering (L1 = ops, L3 = strategy).** Renumbering him to match RFD-serial-lower-is-more-foundational was proposed and rejected: the flight-altitude metaphor is the naming, and a greenfield tag has no reason to invert its source.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2177) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2177  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2177) 'An RFD describes a decision at some altitude of work (portfolio bet, cross-team coordination, or a single team's execution).
 # tags: rfd:details
